# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
# A Python simulation with the groups, and with the dual list, against
# `mdir run` of the same control (D245, #270). The groups are
# not for the deterministic mode, so the two are not equal to the bit: the
# rows of the energy file over 100 steps and the positions at the end agree
# within what two runs of `mdir run` differ by. Inputs/python_groups.py.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_groups.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide mdir %t cli Double | FileCheck %s -DP=Double
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_groups.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide mdir %t cli Mixed | FileCheck %s -DP=Mixed
# CHECK: [[P]] groups: a Python simulation follows mdir run as mdir run follows itself
# CHECK: [[P]] dual: a Python simulation follows mdir run as mdir run follows itself
# CHECK: cli [[P]] passed
